{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12356","headline":"寄袁州李嘉佑员外 · 钱起","name":"寄袁州李嘉佑员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁谓江山阻，心亲梦想偏。\n容辉常在目，离别任经年。\n郡国通流水，云霞共远天。\n行春莺几啭，迟客月频圆。\n雁有归乡羽，人无访戴船。\n愿徴黄霸入，相见玉堦前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}